ays a vital role in maintaining the functionality and safety of transportation and ventilation infrastructure.", "SCADA CONTROL SYSTEM:The SCADA Control System provides remote monitoring and control for Ventilation System A.", "FIRE DETECTION SYSTEM:The Fire Detection System triggers the smoke extraction mode in Ventilation System A during emergencies.", "CLIMATEC SYSTEMS LTD.:Climatec Systems Ltd. is the contractor responsible for the annual overhaul and 24/7 emergency support of Ventilation System A.", "FIRE DEPARTMENT:The Fire Department is automatically notified by the Fire Detection System in case of smoke detection in Ventilation System A.", "SINGLE FAN FAILURE:Single Fan Failure is a failure mode where one fan in Ventilation System A fails, reducing system capacity to 75% and affecting both Station 35 and Station 36, leading to reduced train frequency until repair.", "COMPLETE SYSTEM FAILURE:Complete System Failure is a critical incident where Ventilation System A fails entirely, causing both Station 35 and Station 36 to lose ventilation, requiring immediate evacuation and affecting over 80,000 daily passengers.", "BACKUP FANS:Backup Fans are two 250 kW redundant fans in Ventilation System A, providing redundancy in case of main fan failure.", "AIR SHAFTS:Air Shafts are three vertical shafts in Ventilation System A that connect the underground system to the surface, enabling air exchange.", "CONTROL SYSTEM:The Control System is an automated system with manual override capability that manages the operation of Ventilation System A.", "FILTER INSPECTION AND CLEANING:Filter inspection and cleaning is a weekly maintenance activity for Ventilation System A to ensure air quality and system efficiency.", "FAN MOTOR INSPECTION:Fan motor inspection is a monthly maintenance activity for Ventilation System A to check the condition and performance of fan motors.", "FULL SYSTEM TEST INCLUDING EMERGENCY MODE:Full system test including emergency mode is a quarterly maintenance procedure for Ventilation System A to verify all functions, including emergency operations.", "COMPLETE OVERHAUL:Complete overhaul is an annual maintenance event for Ventilation System A, performed by Climatec Systems Ltd., involving comprehensive inspection and servicing.", "MAIN FAN UNITS:", "STATION 37:Station 37 (Central Hub) is the adjacent southern station to Station 36, located 0.8 km away via tunnel. It serves as an alternative station if Station 36 is unavailable."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-large"}}, "key": "embeddings_c8ff260390474548b13ab6074c49a9c4538185a5fd69c71c6df4ce115d2b6ba5_v2"}